swift-mcp-sdk
=============

This product is a **fork** of the Model Context Protocol Swift SDK:

    https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/swift-sdk

It is not the official SDK, and it is not endorsed by or affiliated with
Anthropic, PBC or the Model Context Protocol project.

