Modifications
-------------

Copyright 2026 Justin Purnell.

Licensed under the same terms as the original work.

The modifications add support for MCP revision `2026-07-28` — per-request
protocol carriage, `server/discover`, `subscriptions/listen`, Multi Round-Trip
Requests (SEP-2322), the `io.modelcontextprotocol/tasks` extension (SEP-2663),
`x-mcp-header` routing (SEP-2243), cacheable results (SEP-2549), and the
`-32020`/`-32021`/`-32022` error allocation (SEP-2575) — together with fixes to
the existing transports. CHANGELOG.md records them in full, and the git history
preserves the authorship of the upstream pull requests adopted along the way.
